    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d581-a1">

                <pb facs="0580" n="1314" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1314"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 657.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to
                            Saïd Pasha.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No. 94.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Will your excellency be pleased to inform
                    Mr. Gargiulo, the dragoman for the United States legation, whether you received
                    and have answered in writing my note, No. 93, of October 28 instant, which <pb
                        facs="0581" n="1315" xml:id="pg1315"/> was sent to you by the same trusted
                    messenger who conveyed to the Porte my former notes, in regard to Guedjian, an
                    American citizen.</p>
                <p>The information is desired before I communicate with my Government.</p>
                <p>Receive, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
